    "clean_anchor_difference": "Clean Anchor Price Acceptance V1 entered every available row at anchor_timestamp plus 10 minutes. The frozen source is an OCO breakout execution whose actual T0 entry occurs at anchor_timestamp plus 5 * entry_step minutes, with entry_step ranging from 1 through 24. Clean Anchor therefore did not compare each actual T0 fill with the exact next provider open after that fill bar.",
